o=A.aj(["kategori",b,"rozet","KR\u0130PTOLU DEL\u0130L","rozetRenk",B.ek,"ikon",B.QU,"q",o,"a",a4?"Cezalar sekmesindeki ihlal kart\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131nda yer alan 'Delil \u0130ncele' butonuna veya Ana Men\xfcdeki 'Radar Foto\u011fraf\u0131 & Kan\u0131t \u0130nceleme' ekran\u0131na t\u0131klayarak ihlal an\u0131n\u0131n y\xfcksek \xe7\xf6z\xfcn\xfcrl\xfckl\xfc radar foto\u011fraf\u0131n\u0131, ara\xe7 plaka yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131n\u0131, radar\u0131n \xf6l\xe7t\xfc\u011f\xfc tam h\u0131z telemetrisini ve PGM tebli\u011f numaras\u0131n\u0131 kriptolu olarak g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyebilirsiniz.":"Click 'Delil \u0130ncele' on your ticket card or go to Menu \u2794 'Radar Photography & Evidence' to view the camera snapshot, plate crop, measured radar speed and official teblig number."],s,r)
