n=a4?"Seyr\xfcsefer harc\u0131m\u0131 online \xf6deyebilir miyim? Gecikirse ne olur?":"Can I pay vehicle road tax (seyr\xfcsefer) online? What are late penalties?"
n=A.aj(["kategori",a2,"rozet","ONL\u0130NE HAR\xc7","rozetRenk",B.u0,"ikon",B.pf,"q",n,"a",a4?"Evet, 'Cezalar & Sigorta' ekran\u0131ndaki 'Seyr\xfcsefer' sekmesine ge\xe7erek kredi kart\u0131n\u0131zla g\xfcvenli resmi \xf6deme yapabilirsiniz. \xd6deme an\u0131nda barkodlu onay makbuzu \xfcretilir.\n\nSeyr\xfcsefer s\xfcresi ge\xe7en ara\xe7lara her ay i\xe7in %2 ila %5 aras\u0131nda gecikme faizi uygulan\u0131r. Seyr\xfcsefersiz ara\xe7 kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 halinde polis taraf\u0131ndan ara\xe7 trafikten men edilebilir ve y\xfcksek para cezas\u0131 kesilir.":"Yes, you can renew your road tax online via the 'Seyr\xfcsefer' tab. A certified barcode receipt is generated. Late renewals incur monthly interest and driving without valid road tax leads to vehicle impoundment."],s,r)
a4=c.a.c
m=a4?"Ara\xe7 fenni muayene tarihini nas\u0131l takip ederim? Cezas\u0131 nedir?":"How do I check my vehicle technical inspection date (fenni muayene)?"
m=A.aj(["kategori",a2,"rozet","MUAYENE TAKV\u0130M\u0130","rozetRenk",B.kr,"ikon",B.pw,"q",m,"a",a4?"KKTC'de ara\xe7 muayeneleri plakan\u0131n son rakam\u0131na g\xf6re Trafik Dairesi'nin yay\u0131mlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 y\u0131ll\u0131k takvimle belirlenir. Uygulama, kay\u0131tl\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n muayene biti\u015f tarihine ka\xe7 g\xfcn kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 canl\u0131 olarak takip eder ve 30 g\xfcn kala uyar\u0131 bildirimi g\xf6nderir.\n\nMuayenesi ge\xe7mi\u015f ara\xe7la trafi\u011fe \xe7\u0131kmak 10 ceza puan\u0131 ve br\xfct asgari \xfccretin %10'u oran\u0131nda para cezas\u0131na tabidir.":"Vehicle inspection schedules are organized by license plate numbers. The app tracks remaining days and sends automatic reminders 30 days prior. Driving without valid inspection results in 10 penalty points and fine."],s,r)
